# standalone
# Starts a new game from the main menu and saves it as h_cordon, the base of every other scene. Return opens the character screen; the click
# is its Start button (920, 864 window points at 3024x1964 pixels = 1512x982 points: run it at that size, -s 3024x1964).
2 console r_screenshot_mode png
5 key Return
8 move 920 864
9 click 920 864
9.5 mark new game started
10 waitlevel 300 l01_escape
14 key Left Shift
17 console run_string xr_harness.mem("newgame 7 s after ready")
20 key Left Shift
27 console run_string xr_harness.mem("newgame 17 s after ready")
27.5 console mem_stats
30 console run_string exec_console_cmd("save h_cordon")
36 console screenshot newgame_start
40 quit
